  m_text: "Log 1\n\n09-03-2025, 17:43\n\nProgress is slower than I anticipated. My
    hands are getting worse by the day, and fine motor control is becoming a problem.
    I managed to secure an off-market compound for the panacea project: Nocropro.
    If the reports are accurate, it may help regenerate damaged dopamine pathways.
    I\u2019ll begin trials on the mice tonight."
